    "description": "Minimal Postman Collection v2.1 containing strictly the 10 REST APIs specified in Section 10 of the assignment.\n\nSwitch `baseUrl` collection variable between:\n- Local Express Runner: http://localhost:3000/api (or http://localhost:3000)\n- AWS API Gateway: https://<api-id>.execute-api.<region>.amazonaws.com/prod",
